sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Usuario
    participant SK as Spec Kit
    participant Git as Git
    participant GH as GitHub

    User->>SK: specify (crear spec)
    SK->>SK: Generar spec.md
    SK->>Git: Auto-commit<br/>[Spec Kit] Add specification
    Git->>GH: Push a rama feature
    GH->>GH: Crear Pull Request #1
    User->>User: Revisar spec en PR #1

    Note over User,GH: ✓ Aprobación de spec
    
    User->>GH: Merge PR #1
    GH->>Git: main ← feature/spec
    Git->>User: Pull en local

    User->>SK: plan (crear plan)
    SK->>SK: Generar plan.md<br/>+ design docs
    SK->>Git: Auto-commit<br/>[Spec Kit] Add implementation plan
    Git->>User: Cambios listos

    Note over User,SK: ✓ Revisión manual del plan

    User->>SK: tasks (generar tareas)
    SK->>SK: Generar tasks.md<br/>+ dependencias
    SK->>Git: Auto-commit<br/>[Spec Kit] Add tasks
    Git->>User: Cambios listos

    Note over User,SK: ✓ Revisión de tareas

    User->>SK: implement (ejecutar tareas)
    SK->>SK: Procesar tasks.md
    SK->>SK: Ejecutar implementación
    SK->>Git: Auto-commit<br/>[Spec Kit] Implementation progress
    loop Por cada tarea
        SK->>SK: Implementar + Validar
        SK->>Git: Commits de cambios
    end
    Git->>User: Código implementado

    User->>Git: git push
    Git->>GH: Push a rama feature
    GH->>GH: Crear Pull Request #2
    User->>User: Revisar implementación en PR #2

    Note over User,GH: ✓ Code Review + Tests
    
    User->>GH: Merge PR #2
    GH->>Git: main ← feature/implementation
    
    Note over User,GH: ✅ Feature completada en main
